title: XML External Entity (XXE) Injection
id: 121059f7-df15-4623-b2ce-a2afafb8f97a
status: experimental
description: Detects XML External Entity injection payloads in request bodies, indicated by DOCTYPE with ENTITY definitions referencing SYSTEM file:// or http:// URIs, used to read local files or perform SSRF.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - '<!ENTITY'
      - '<!DOCTYPE'
      - 'SYSTEM "file:'
      - 'SYSTEM "http'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Applications legitimately processing DTDs
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
